{"case_id": "male_19710412_P005-Q23", "domain": "career", "question": "命主工作收入平均如何？", "expected_answer": "C", "predicted_answer": "B", "raw_answer": "根据命主八字信息，日主丁火生于辰月，土旺火相，但月干壬水正官透出，年柱辛亥金水相生，时柱戊申土金相生，整体财官旺而日主偏弱。丁火坐卯木偏印生身，但地支卯辰相害，申卯暗合，财星（金）与官星（水）力量较强，而火土助力不足。命局中财星（金）透于时干戊土伤官生财，伤官生财格局通常代表通过专业技能或口才谋财，但日主身弱，需大运扶身方能担财。\n\n此命早年走木火运（如甲午、乙未），身转强，事业财运有提升；中年后走金水运（如庚子、辛丑），财官过旺而身弱，压力增大，收入虽高但开销也大，且易有财务波动。综合来看，命主属于中上收入水平，但非大富大贵，且需靠努力和专业技能获取，年薪应能超过50万新台币，但达到100万以上需看具体大运配合。当前（2023年后）若行运至火土帮身，则收入可观，但整体判断，年薪过50万新台币是合理的，过100万则需更佳运势。\n\n最终答案：B", "correct": false, "evidence_coverage": 1.0, "safety_score": 1.0, "parser_source": "reasoned_final_answer", "parser_valid": true, "rag_k": 2, "retrieval_mode": "legacy", "rag_trace": [], "option_evidence": {}, "option_evidence_coverage": {}, "retrieved_answer_leak": false, "config_id": null, "call_success": true, "permutation_id": null, "label_map": {}, "predicted_identity": null, "correct_identity": null, "mode": "off-3", "parser_failure_reason": "unshuffle_map_failed", "attempt_key": ["baziqa_contest8_2024_holdout_enriched", "baziqa_xjz_reasoned", "b1a_prime", "main", "deepseek", "deepseek-v4-flash", "male_19710412_P005-Q23", 2, 0, "p0"], "terminal_state": "parsed", "raw_response_path": "G:\\project\\agent-6b2-v4flash\\docs\\phase6\\6b2\\runs\\phase6-6b2-v4flash-nt-20260805-r1\\dev\\2024_b1a_prime_2_g2\\details.jsonl", "finish_reason": "stop", "latency_ms": 5619, "response_id": "a2d9d6d7-41b1-4589-9e38-e5d57e3f2bea", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 225, "completion_tokens": 304, "total_tokens": 529, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 128}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 128, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 97}, "requested_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "response_model": "deepseek-v4-flash", "thinking_mode": "disabled"}
